					"nextDialogs": [
						751480203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751480203,
					"content": "That's gotta be the volcano's mouth, right? What a view...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751480204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751480204,
					"content": "Hmm... When we asked for directions earlier, weren't we told that there's a ton of gaseous phlogiston in the volcano's mouth?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751480205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751480205,
					"content": "Oh wait, that's right! We can <color=#00E1FFFF>find a way to pass through gaseous phlogiston</color>, just like that Qucusaur did!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751480206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751480206,
					"content": "But, uh... *gulp* Kinda high up, aren't we?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751480207,
						751480210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751480207,
					"content": "Don't worry, Paimon, I'll carry you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751480208
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751480208,
					"content": "Rawr!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751480209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 751480209,
					"content": "Err, you're all set to take the plunge too? Well... Um, alright. I—If that's the case, Paimon's not that scared anymore either.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751480214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751480214,
					"content": "And it's not just that we're high up — don't forget about the gaseous phlogiston!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751480215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751480215,
					"content": "A—Anyway, let's make sure we're all set before we go!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751480210,
					"content": "As long as you grab me just as we land...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751480211
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751480211,
					"content": "Not gonna happen! Never mind the strength problem — think about how hard the timing would be!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751480212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751480212,
					"content": "Rawr!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751480213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
